  '{"Price list":"re-sound acoustic booths, price list 2026","Currency":"EUR","Valid from":"21.09.2026","Validity":"Valid until a new version is published. Technical changes to product or materials reserved.","Price basis":"Sales prices, exclusive of VAT and exclusive of delivery/installation (EXW, Incoterms 2020).","Delivery & installation":"Optional, quoted separately for a fee.","Production time":"4 weeks","Packaging":"Cardboard on pallet.","Ordering":"Order by re-sound article number. One body line (RS-xx-BF or RS-xx-BG), then one line per chosen colour, table, door orientation and socket type, then the accessories. See ''Article code key''.","Order example":"RS-M4-BF, RS-M4-XW, RS-M4-FC, RS-M4-CW, RS-M4-TW, RS-M4-SFC, RS-M4-DL, RS-M4-PE, RS-M4-OMK","Supplier":"re-sound BV","Address":"to complete","VAT-ID":"to complete","Website":"re-sound.be","Certification":"CE, PEFC"}'::jsonb, '[{"model":"Solo ECO","unit":"1 unit","pallet":"230 x 120 x 70 cm","grossKg":330},{"model":"Solo Flex","unit":"1 unit","pallet":"230 x 120 x 60 cm","grossKg":330},{"model":"Solo Stand","unit":"2 units","pallet":"230 x 120 x 100 cm","grossKg":630},{"model":"Duo Work","unit":"1 unit, without table","pallet":"230 x 120 x 95 cm","grossKg":395},{"model":"Duo Flex","unit":"1 unit, with table","pallet":"230 x 120 x 115 cm","grossKg":420},{"model":"Modular 4","unit":"1 unit","pallet":"230 x 120 x 170 cm","grossKg":650},{"model":"Modular XL","unit":"Base, 2 pallets","pallet":"2x 230 x 120 x 120 cm","grossKg":800}]'::jsonb, '[{"territory":"International","name":"Michael Nicasens","email":"michael@re-sound.be","phone":"+32485483035","base":"Belgium"}]'::jsonb, array['One sheet per booth model. Every construction variant, colour, table, door orientation, accessory and fire-protection article is one row with its own re-sound article number.', 'Yellow cells in the Qty column are the only cells to fill in. Blue figures are your input, black figures are formulas, green figures are links to another sheet.', 'Line total = Sales price x Qty. The total row at the bottom of each sheet sums the configuration you entered.', 'Each model sheet opens with Qty = 1 on the closed-backwall base unit as a worked example. Clear it and enter your own configuration.', 'Prices shown as ''incl.'' are EUR 0 and are included in the base price; they still need their article number on the order.', 'All prices are re-sound sales prices in EUR, excluding VAT and excluding delivery and installation (EXW, Incoterms 2020).', '''Article code key'' explains how the article numbers are built. ''All options'' is the same catalogue as one flat, filterable list.', 'Fire protection on Modular XL (RS-MX-FP) is priced per 0.9 m segment, not per booth. Multiply by the number of segments.', 'Modular XL extension segments AS1 / AS2 / AS3 are cumulative alternatives, not add-ons - pick one line, never several.', 'Sofa fabric codes are not fixed yet. Decide whether the fabric becomes a suffix (RS-M4-SFX-2441) or a free-text line on the order.', 'Solo ECO Stand has no anthracite exterior, no DIN-right door and a single felt colour, so the codes RS-SE-XA, RS-SE-DR and RS-SE-FG / FL / FC do not exist.', 'Packaging table on ''Terms & contacts'': the pallet variants were split one per model during the rename. Solo Flex and Solo Stand share both the 1-unit and 2-unit pallet, and Duo Work and Duo Flex share both the with-table and without-table pallet.']::text[], '4743dfbd-resound_booths_price_list_2026.xlsx', true)
